body: "Overlap rechecked against current CLI and sibling source: pm-starter demonstrates SDK capability calls; pm-lint judges item prose; core context relevance evaluations grade read ranking. None applies bundled preset settings to an isolated synthetic tracker and executes agent lifecycle workflows. Provide a typed SDK and compact CLI simulation report, typed refusals with remedies, README and example, no-git regressions, behavioral revert proof, public fleet-copy validation, and CI npm plus Bun release gates."
